    </files>
  </knowledge>
  <notes>MAIN SESSION 2026-10-05: the route refusal was REVERTED (it failed 6 UAC-r2 tests in tests/integration/auth/UnifiedAccessControl, which this project may not edit). Shipped: the composer's record link (the owner's decision in full). Route retirement handed to UAC-r2 with notes/098-share-link-route-refusal.patch. Criterion 3 (typed refusal) is therefore NOT met here by design.</notes>

